{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.11369695027669272,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.12730790332692743,"c":1,"h":0.016751411806427807,"y":0.09772894523873854},{"y":0.13846638667037847,"h":0.019833031194931738,"w":0.62783355712890621,"c":1,"t":"Until the 19th century, soap was regarded as a luxury item, and was heavily taxed in","x":0.12950046102861687},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.12757200642963662,"c":1,"t":"several countries. As it became more readily available, it became an everyday necessity, a","w":0.67695475260416671,"y":0.15547703167975357},{"h":0.016615298106055332,"x":0.12751664111587993,"y":0.16811544184815563,"t":"development that was reinforced when the high tax was removed. Soap was then something","c":1,"w":0.68940958658854168},{"y":0.18261239943579854,"c":1,"t":"ordinary people could afford, and cleanliness standards improved.","h":0.017656543650812484,"w":0.49607645670572914,"x":0.12745654348982466},{"h":0.0156559893604723,"x":0.129562024767714,"t":"With this widespread use came the development of milder soaps for bathing and soaps for use","y":0.20422211963798864,"w":0.68943349202473958,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"in the washing machines that were available to consumers by the turn of the 20th century.","x":0.12749591808377089,"w":0.65452306111653646,"h":0.018851647528658533,"y":0.2189709011659724},{"t":"Q40","h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.8580246919615695,"y":0.1686046510219612,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"y":0.91569767469917918,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166323,"t":"112","x":0.13168724316032629}],"h":3395}